CeTA: certified termination analysis
==================================

The current build, proof-checking, and CPF 4 instructions are in README.md.

CPF 4 user guide: xml/CPF4.md (examples, schema validation, checking,
source binding, compatibility, and troubleshooting).
Certificate interfaces across all categories: xml/CERTIFICATE_FORMATS.md.

CPF 5 user guide: xml/CPF5.md (ITS and higher-order XML, embedded children,
checking commands and explicit legacy compatibility).

CPF 6 user guide: xml/CPF6.md (LP, cut and Prolog source certificates).
